    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "He taught us how to regain popularity."
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I think it the best way to success to work hard. (I think the best way to success is to work hard.)"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I couldn't decide whether to go or not."
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Three Asian concerns agreed to pay more than one million dollars in fines."
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I waited for her to come."
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I had no choice but to study English."
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Don't let me interrupt you."
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "We hope to hear from you."
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "We sought to reach an agreement."
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "He managed to save some money."
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Let bygones be bygones."
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "If someone calls for me while I am out, please have him call 725-1081."
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Let me get it."
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "He was in a unique position to help her avert this threat."
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "The government permits the company to import the cars duty free."
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Weather reports help us plan our activities."
        }
      ]
    },
